# 13. CENTRAL SAFETY ELIGIBILITY ENGINE

This is the most important business component.

Implement the eligibility engine as trusted backend logic backed by PostgreSQL.

Suggested operations:

`evaluate_booking_eligibility`

`request_booking`

`approve_booking`

`reject_booking`

`check_in_booking`

`check_out_booking`

