This is an illustrative response shape. Generate real values from persisted records.

## Safety requirements

* Fail closed when required evidence is missing or invalid.
* Use consistent rules across all entry points.
* Re-evaluate eligibility when a booking is committed.
* Revalidate eligibility at check-in.
* Define whether credentials must remain valid throughout the booking.
* Apply safety holds immediately.
* Record the applicable policy version.
* Preserve the decision and reasons for audit.
* Prevent unauthorized manual overrides.
* Require explicit, authorized clearance before removing applicable holds.

Never rely solely on frontend validation.

